name: Bug report
description: Something does not work the way the docs say it should.
labels: ["type: bug", "status: needs-triage"]
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        Thanks for the report. **Security problems do not go here**: use [private vulnerability reporting](https://github.com/{{.Owner}}/{{.Name}}/security/advisories/new).
        Please redact secrets from anything you paste.
  - type: textarea
    id: what
    attributes:
      label: What happened?
      description: What you did, what you expected and what you got instead.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: repro
    attributes:
      label: Steps to reproduce
      description: The smallest set of commands that shows the problem.
      render: shell
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: input
    id: version
    attributes:
      label: Version or commit
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: input
    id: os
    attributes:
      label: OS and hardware
      placeholder: "macOS 15.1, Apple M3"
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: logs
    attributes:
      label: Relevant logs
      description: Lines from `.logs/<service>.log`.
      render: text
  - type: checkboxes
    id: checks
    attributes:
      label: Before you submit
      options:
        - label: I searched the open issues and this is not a duplicate.
          required: true
        - label: I removed secrets and private data from everything I pasted.
          required: true
